\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Morphology and quenched fractions versus stellar mass. Rows show BGG E/S fractions, satellite E/S fractions, and quenched BGG/satellite fractions. All six panels use edges \(7.0, 10.0, 10.5, 11.0, 12.5\); points are placed at the median mass in each bin. Binomial uncertainties are drawn with G.~Mamon's \texttt  {binomialerrorplot}; empty/full bins use its one-sided Wilson limits. Bins with fewer than five galaxies or three physical groups are omitted.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
